   },
   {
    "quote": "The Express Building is located just to the left after entering Osanbashi from the Osanbashi entrance intersection on Kaigan-dori. It stands like a gatekeeper, as if Enma-sama himself is standing there to check people trying to enter Osanbashi. It is a slightly retro and stylish building that looks like it could house the office of an unsuccessful detective in a hard-boiled story set in the port.",
    "url": "https://note.com/cute_gnu255/n/n1ca678501feb?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Originally built in 1930 as the headquarters building of Japan Express Co., Ltd., it is a reinforced concrete structure with three floors above ground and one floor below ground.",
