    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "The exterior wall is a reddish-beige tile with thick brick-colored lines surrounding the large windows. It is a building with an impressive contrast of unique coloring, with white tiles filling the space around the vertical, regular windows.",
    "url": "https://note.com/cute_gnu255/n/n1ca678501feb?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "■ The building name remains Express Building even if the owner changes",
